"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_13.png","alignment":"center","hero_layout":"full_width","hero_size":"small","text_size":"large","title":"Butternutbaby","text":"<p>FREE SHIPPING IN NZ ON ALL ORDERS $99 & OVER<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"SHOP NOW!","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/shop-all"}},"collection":{"type":"collection","settings":{"title":"Featured collections","collection":"dino","grid":5,"rows":2,"show_vendor":false,"show_view_all":true}},"hero-2":{"type":"hero","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/292476192_431476172324471_7257867130181175569_n.png","alignment":"top","hero_layout":"full_width","hero_size":"small","text_size":"medium","title":"Save the World AND Save your Money","text":"<p><em>I<\/em><em><strong>t’s time to take action to minimise the damage that disposable nappies create in our eco system.<\/strong><\/em><\/p><p><em><strong>Just as we are switching from single use plastics, so we must consider our consumption of single use nappies. <\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"Why it Matters","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/why-it-matters"}},"quotes":{"type":"quotes","blocks":{"quotes-1":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>The fitted nappies are awesome. We have been using Butternutbaby fitted nappies exclusively as our night nappy with a waterproof cover over top and they are excellent! It is possible to up the absorbency even more, but the standard recommended setup has been more than enough for our big ten month old boy so far. 100 percent recommended! Awesome design, comfort and absorbency.<\/em><\/p>","author":"Tomas  - NZ"}},"quotes-0":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>We got a Butternutbaby nappy (rainbow one of course), a large size for our big boy. Extremely roomy and easy to put on! NB we didn't get inserts so pair it on night nappies or other inserts and works really well. Great prompt service from Helen, positive experience  Thank you!<\/em><\/p>","author":"Louisa -  NZ"}},"quotes-2":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>I got a reusable pocket nappy from Butternutbaby. Helen was really nice and had great communication. The lining of the nappy is great, poop just falls straight off and is easy to clean and super soft against my baby’s bottom.<\/em><\/p>","author":"Abbi - NZ"}},"b2a308de-e5b0-4339-a7f5-f885a62ba53e":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>Great product, and Helen is so helpful and kind! Excellent customer service and so very nice to know that I can go to her with any questions or issues that pop up and she'll give great support! Can't recommend highly enough!<br\/><\/em><br\/><\/p>","author":"Emma  - Wellington NZ"}},"11ed36ab-a829-48a5-998d-a8bd12e0d3ef":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><br\/>Beautiful quality nappies at a great price. These are my favourite for no leaks and the inserts are super absorbent.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","author":"Kate  -  Riverhead NZ"}},"5bac7f98-925d-4862-bf59-0ad9afed8d01":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>I have to say these nappies are the BEST for keeping my honey bee dry because the material stays so dry to the touch. Thanks Butternut Baby for your awesome nappies!<\/em><br\/><br\/><br\/><\/p>","author":"Stella  - Auckland NZ"}},"44bf537f-aea2-4064-b2b4-408888ac9f82":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>I recommend Butternutbaby, I got one give away and the charcoal lining is the most comfortable nappy I've seen. I have several from Other brands and this was the best we used.<\/em><br\/><br\/><\/p>","author":"Rafaela  - MCN Discussion FB"}},"4c0c1a2d-244e-4746-ac4f-14029eeab3b1":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>Helen generously made Velcro converters for my snap nappies when I broke my finger and leg which made doing snaps up quite difficult. She had great communication and the turn around time was nice and quick. Definitely recommend!<\/em><br\/><br\/><\/p>","author":"Tamara  - NZ"}},"2ed3c553-8c9a-412f-8de8-607386f8887b":{"type":"quote","settings":{"quote":"<p><em>Totally agree with <\/em>previous <em>recommendation,  Butternutbaby night nappy is a winner, and the hemp inserts are amazing, very absorbent and excellent prices!<\/em><\/p>","author":"Natalie  - North Shore, Auckland"}}},"block_order":["quotes-1","quotes-0","quotes-2","b2a308de-e5b0-4339-a7f5-f885a62ba53e","11ed36ab-a829-48a5-998d-a8bd12e0d3ef","5bac7f98-925d-4862-bf59-0ad9afed8d01","44bf537f-aea2-4064-b2b4-408888ac9f82","4c0c1a2d-244e-4746-ac4f-14029eeab3b1","2ed3c553-8c9a-412f-8de8-607386f8887b"],"settings":{"title":""}},"image-bar":{"type":"image-bar","blocks":{"image-bar-0":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Add_a_heading_2.jpg","alignment":"center","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/copy-of-how-to-care-for-your-butternut-baby-nappies","cta_label":"HOW TO USE AND CARE FOR YOUR BUTTERNUT NAPPIES"}},"79eea9bb-9da7-4aa2-94d5-573641d2d1ed":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Add_a_heading_41.jpg","alignment":"top","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/bamboo-facts","cta_label":"WHATS THE DEAL WITH THE CHARCOAL LINING?"}},"05d904b2-1a6c-45ad-9220-4338be515a07":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2022-01-27_195107.jpg","alignment":"center","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/fun-ideas-for-toddlers","cta_label":"FUN IDEAS FOR BABIES & TODDLERS!"}},"c5c08d50-9438-44b0-870c-509c675bc7de":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Add_a_heading_7.jpg","alignment":"center","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/baby-shower-service","cta_label":"BABY SHOWER SERVICE"}}},"block_order":["image-bar-0","79eea9bb-9da7-4aa2-94d5-573641d2d1ed","05d904b2-1a6c-45ad-9220-4338be515a07","c5c08d50-9438-44b0-870c-509c675bc7de"],"settings":{"section_height":"small"}},"footer":{"type":"footer","blocks":{"footer-0":{"type":"link_list","settings":{"title":"Quick links","menu":"footer"}},"footer-1":{"type":"newsletter","settings":{"title":"Newsletter"}}},"block_order":["footer-0","footer-1"],"